etter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:26.8pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-26.8pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">설문 결과는 향후 교육분야 정부조직 체계에 대한 정책 의견 수렴에만 활용된다고 하오니</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">교직원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">학생</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">학부모 등 교육 현장의 목소리가 반영될 수 있도록 설문조사에 협조하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">조사 기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2022. 1. 7.(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">∼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">1. 14.(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">    </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">조사 방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">인터넷을 활용한 온라인 설문조사</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-right:5.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">설문조사 링크 주소 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0pt;\"><a href=\"https://forms.gle/PGMHByTqwSHQgFgz9\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://forms.gle/PGMHByTqwSHQgFgz9</a></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:59.3pt;margin-right:5.0pt;text-indent:-59.3pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">       </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">학내에서 구글</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">웹하드 등</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-size:12.0pt;\">을 차단했을 경우에는 해당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">URL</span><span style=\"font-family:한양신명조;mso-fareast-font-family:한양신명조;font-s